          "Hadith.2447 - Al-Sakuni narrated with his chain of transmission that the Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace and blessings of Allah (swt) be upon him and his family) said:\n\"The provision of the traveller is chanting and poetry, as long as it contains nothing immoral.\""
